<item>
  <title>Trichomes in Mimosa (Leguminosae): Towards a characterization and a terminology standardization</title>
  <link>https://lsbjordao.github.io/posts/Trichomes-in-Mimosa/</link>
  <description><![CDATA[ 




<div class="quarto-figure quarto-figure-center">
<figure class="figure">
