</figure>
</div>
<p>This study presents a comprehensive analysis of the trichome characteristics in <em>Mimosa</em> (Leguminosae). The authors aimed to characterize and standardize the terminology used to describe trichomes in this genus.</p>
<p><a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.flora.2020.151702">https://doi.org/10.1016/j.flora.2020.151702</a></p>



 ]]></description>
